    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάντᾰλος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Tantalus</u>, ancestor of the Pelopidae, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			11.582
		</span></i>, etc.; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνῆκα γὰρ τοὺς Ταντάλου κήπους
					τρυγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					530
				</span></i>
			:— Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταντάλ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
			(v. infr.), <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to T.</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Τ. ἔκγονοι</span> the descendants <i>of
				T.</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				1176
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέλοψ ὁ Τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				988
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρία Ταντάλειος</span>
			Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.45.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.512
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τ. δίκας ὑποφέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταντά̆λ-εος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.235
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταντᾰλ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.187
			</span></i>:</div>
